    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-Op Gameplay Experience</h2>Explore, drill, and produce oil on your own or team up with up to five friends. Work together for faster progress and make strategic decisions to run a successful operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oil Exploration and Extraction</h2>Lease land from the municipality to search for oil. Extract crude oil and transport it to your storage facilities using barrels or tanker trucks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/97f2775e6269c4316893c8bda1006239.poster.avif?t=1754111571\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/97f2775e6269c4316893c8bda1006239.webm?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/97f2775e6269c4316893c8bda1006239.mp4?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Production and Market Sales</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process crude oil into petroleum products using industrial machinery, then set your own prices and sell them in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/70a55b4ba4b8c7f10cdb00af61696f71.poster.avif?t=1754111571\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/70a55b4ba4b8c7f10cdb00af61696f71.webm?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/70a55b4ba4b8c7f10cdb00af61696f71.mp4?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fuel Production and Sales</h2>Refine crude oil into a variety of fuels such as diesel and gasoline. Negotiate with gas stations to sell your products and maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Valuable Discoveries</h2>During excavations, you\u2019ll uncover not only oil but also precious gems, fossils, and minerals. Add them to your collection and earn extra revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/fd4ffffbcd38c990e7d7256db8fa2831.poster.avif?t=1754111571\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/fd4ffffbcd38c990e7d7256db8fa2831.webm?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/fd4ffffbcd38c990e7d7256db8fa2831.mp4?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment Upgrades</h2>Enhance everything from your detectors and vehicles to your oil pumps. Expand your brand and grow your factory to increase efficiency and output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultimate Goal: Become the City\u2019s Leading Oil Supplier</h2>As you earn more money, unlock new regions, acquire larger equipment, and aim to become the sole provider of oil that powers the entire city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/faa97fddbd12e6387424759b6964c671.poster.avif?t=1754111571\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/faa97fddbd12e6387424759b6964c671.webm?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/faa97fddbd12e6387424759b6964c671.mp4?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a strategic, cooperative, and exploratory adventure!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-Op Gameplay Experience</h2>Explore, drill, and produce oil on your own or team up with up to five friends. Work together for faster progress and make strategic decisions to run a successful operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Oil Exploration and Extraction</h2>Lease land from the municipality to search for oil. Extract crude oil and transport it to your storage facilities using barrels or tanker trucks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/97f2775e6269c4316893c8bda1006239.poster.avif?t=1754111571\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/97f2775e6269c4316893c8bda1006239.webm?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/97f2775e6269c4316893c8bda1006239.mp4?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Production and Market Sales</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process crude oil into petroleum products using industrial machinery, then set your own prices and sell them in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/70a55b4ba4b8c7f10cdb00af61696f71.poster.avif?t=1754111571\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/70a55b4ba4b8c7f10cdb00af61696f71.webm?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/70a55b4ba4b8c7f10cdb00af61696f71.mp4?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fuel Production and Sales</h2>Refine crude oil into a variety of fuels such as diesel and gasoline. Negotiate with gas stations to sell your products and maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Valuable Discoveries</h2>During excavations, you\u2019ll uncover not only oil but also precious gems, fossils, and minerals. Add them to your collection and earn extra revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/fd4ffffbcd38c990e7d7256db8fa2831.poster.avif?t=1754111571\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/fd4ffffbcd38c990e7d7256db8fa2831.webm?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/fd4ffffbcd38c990e7d7256db8fa2831.mp4?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment Upgrades</h2>Enhance everything from your detectors and vehicles to your oil pumps. Expand your brand and grow your factory to increase efficiency and output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultimate Goal: Become the City\u2019s Leading Oil Supplier</h2>As you earn more money, unlock new regions, acquire larger equipment, and aim to become the sole provider of oil that powers the entire city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/faa97fddbd12e6387424759b6964c671.poster.avif?t=1754111571\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/faa97fddbd12e6387424759b6964c671.webm?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441460/extras/faa97fddbd12e6387424759b6964c671.mp4?t=1754111571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a strategic, cooperative, and exploratory adventure!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Play solo or co-op with up to 5 players to find oil, store crude, refine fuels, and sell them at gas stations and shop. Dig for gems and fossils, upgrade your gear, lease new land, and dominate the city as the biggest oil supplier!",
